 Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive and Compassionate Care for Pets Every Hour, Every Day\nMedVet Mountain View serves as an extension of your family veterinarian, providing advanced emergency and specialty care from experts and board-certified specialists.\nThousands of patients come through our doors each year, and our trusted team treats each pet like our own. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional and compassionate care. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet and get them home with you where they belong.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Mountain View Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nStephanie LaPlume, DVM\nMedical Director\nKimberly McLaughlin, CVPM\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nZachary Ang\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlexa L. Danner\n, DVM, MS, Diplomate, American College of Veterinary Surgeons (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nKristianne L. Guevara\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJaclyn Iseman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRachel Jorgensen\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nSonya Karchemskiy\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nStephanie La Plume\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlex Lundhild\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNicole McClure\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCheri Nielsen\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nJenna  Passer\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMeera Ramesh\n, BVSc, MS, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nJennifer Ree\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nAubrey Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlexys Wang\n, VMD\nEmergency Medicine\nAnnie Yeh\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n16\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nRushed here during an emergency with my beloved pup on a weekday evening. The caring staff treated both of us with such kindness, and the vet thoughtfully explained everything before proceeding. Their compassion during a scary time meant the world to us. Highly recommend to any pet parent.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
